            {
                "entry_id": "6a285c4a-48b8-3b02-99d2-a4d75585bfce",
                "word": "touche-à-tout",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a281f62d-d62b-34ce-a208-53631321478c",
                        "entry_id": "6a285c4a-48b8-3b02-99d2-a4d75585bfce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui s’intéresse à plein de domaines différents."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c8005f4-9464-4237-aa0a-d21a71bba057",
                                "sense_id": "a281f62d-d62b-34ce-a208-53631321478c",
                                "text": "Grâce à des savoirs acquis dès l'enfance dans sa famille de potiers touche-à-tout, Chloé a presque tout réalisé seule, en organisant aussi une journée de chantier participatif, et en accueillant des volontaires étrangers."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "88c1814a-cc88-3c29-8998-f9130175bd5c",
                        "entry_id": "6a285c4a-48b8-3b02-99d2-a4d75585bfce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est polyvalent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7f27566-a5b1-3019-b563-fccb0894c52a",
                        "entry_id": "6a285c4a-48b8-3b02-99d2-a4d75585bfce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui aime à se mêler indiscrètement de tout ce qui ne le regarde pas."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "22bb01c6-d891-412b-ba52-44530ac984a1",
                                "sense_id": "c7f27566-a5b1-3019-b563-fccb0894c52a",
                                "text": "Un enfant touche-à-tout."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "807f188c-669d-4b4c-8b06-75a7b571fc96",
                                "sense_id": "c7f27566-a5b1-3019-b563-fccb0894c52a",
                                "text": "D’autre part, que Léon XIII conseille aux catholiques français d’être moins rétifs au gouvernement de la République, et pour lui, comme pour les invités de la belle Madame de…, ce pape touche-à-tout n’est plus que l’évêque de Rome."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "8d240af7-ef20-3108-a4bb-93355f5865e8",
                "word": "touche-à-tout",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6683d088-f9cd-392e-9809-d3e5d7d1bb64",
                        "entry_id": "8d240af7-ef20-3108-a4bb-93355f5865e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne, généralement un enfant, qui touche tout ce qu’elle trouve."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bbd00c06-695e-34d8-be79-5f47895a37a1",
                        "entry_id": "8d240af7-ef20-3108-a4bb-93355f5865e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne ayant de nombreux centres d’intérêt dans des domaines variés mais qui ne les étudie que de façon superficielle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "78e60b73-5620-4bfd-a9dd-eb4697543fd9",
                                "sense_id": "bbd00c06-695e-34d8-be79-5f47895a37a1",
                                "text": "Cet homme là est un touche-à-tout."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25395753-149e-4084-8e8c-7d636300396a",
                                "sense_id": "bbd00c06-695e-34d8-be79-5f47895a37a1",
                                "text": "En littérature, en musique, c’est carrément impossible de changer de direction, on est certain de se faire lyncher. D’un autre côté si tu fais toujours la même chose on t’accuse de te répéter et d’être sur le déclin, mais si tu changes on t’accuse d’être un touche-à-tout incohérent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6587d84-6363-4ff8-930a-1e627ca70c8d",
                                "sense_id": "bbd00c06-695e-34d8-be79-5f47895a37a1",
                                "text": "S’était établie une petite académie touche à tout. On apprenait – on s’apprenait – des notions hétéroclites mais passionnantes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c34ebe05-49b9-4aa7-907a-25b0be161e50",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d240af7-ef20-3108-a4bb-93355f5865e8",
                        "target_lang_word": "jack of all trades",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jack of all trades",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                        "entry_id": "06ee170b-514f-3afe-b97e-97bc57f34a5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One competent in many endeavours, sometimes regarded as not excelling in any of them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2038f1cb-40f9-4add-ab36-7e56774c5c89",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "Novv for the moſt part your Porter is either ſome broken Cittizen, vvho hath plaid Iack of all trades, ſome Pander, Broker, or Hangman, that hath plaid the knaue vvith all men, and for the more certainty his Embleme is a red Beard, to vvhich Sacke hath made his Noſe couſin German."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14e7aa89-7087-4a0f-aff5-57d6e325c62e",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "Printer, postmaster, almanac maker, essayist, chemist, orator, tinker, statesman, humorist, philosopher, parlor man, political economist, professor of housewifery, ambassador, projector, maxim-monger, herb-doctor, wit:—Jack of all trades, master of each and mastered by none—the type and genius of his land."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce0a0ce-f2b1-47f1-b5f6-92f17db576c8",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "\"I am my own engineer, and my own carpenter, and my own plumber, and my own gardener, and my own Jack of all Trades,\" said Wemmick, in acknowledging my compliments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d63874e2-b499-49e2-b834-227b7d75d73f",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "A fellow can always get some sort of a job—I was coming up here to see if they needed an extra clerk or a waiter, or chauffeur, or anything that meant a roof and something to eat—but I suppose they don't need a jack-of-all-trades."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f07cbfdf-b61e-42c3-aa9b-118c204fe866",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "In 1823, when this drawing was made, there was anesthesia for dentistry and in fact very little dentistry except the extraction of teeth. Much of this extraction was conducted by itinerant quacks or jacks-of-all-trades who did it as a side line to their business."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cff29a20-8136-46ee-8cac-c6941f5dab70",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d240af7-ef20-3108-a4bb-93355f5865e8",
                        "target_lang_word": "jack of all trades, master of none",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
